{
  "key": "yourlie",
  "name": "Your Lie in April",
  "quotes": [
    {"text":"Je t'aime, Kosei Arima.","speaker":"Kaori Miyazono","recipient":"à Kosei, dans sa dernière lettre","aliases":["Kaori"]},
    {"text":"Arima Kosei, tu seras mon accompagnateur !","speaker":"Kaori Miyazono","recipient":"à Kosei","aliases":["Kaori"]},
    {"text":"La musique, c'est la liberté !","speaker":"Kaori Miyazono","recipient":"à Kosei","aliases":["Kaori"]},
    {"text":"Je n'entends plus le son de mon piano.","speaker":"Kosei Arima","recipient":"à Tsubaki","aliases":["Kosei"]},
    {"text":"Kosei, t'es vraiment un idiot !","speaker":"Tsubaki Sawabe","recipient":"à Kosei","aliases":["Tsubaki"]},
    {"text":"Un jour, je te dépasserai, Arima.","speaker":"Takeshi Aiza","recipient":"à Kosei","aliases":["Takeshi"]},
    {"text":"Je joue pour que tu m'entendes, Kosei Arima.","speaker":"Emi Igawa","recipient":"à Kosei","aliases":["Emi"]},
    {"text":"Tu dois jouer sans la moindre erreur, Kosei.","speaker":"Saki Arima","recipient":"à Kosei","aliases":["Saki"]},
    {"text":"Joue pour quelqu'un, Kosei. C'est comme ça que la musique prend vie.","speaker":"Hiroko Seto","recipient":"à Kosei","aliases":["Hiroko"]},
    {"text":"Les filles, je m'y connais, fais-moi confiance.","speaker":"Ryota Watari","recipient":"à Kosei","aliases":["Watari"]}
  ],
